<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>You can edit a profile while an app automation is running the fans. The automation stays in charge: your changes are saved to the profile without running, and take effect the next time the profile is active.</li>
<li>If you change the profile that comes back when the automation&#x27;s app quits, it comes back with your new settings.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
