            <title>1.0.25</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 14:13:03 +0900</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>200</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.25</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>
  body { font: -apple-system-body, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
  h3 { font-size: 13px; margin: 14px 0 6px; }
  h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  ul { margin: 6px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
  p { margin: 6px 0; }
</style>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Profiles can be changed. Press a profile&#x27;s pencil on the Profiles page: its settings go on the fans, and you change modes, speeds, curves and the fan link with the same controls as Overview. Save keeps the changes. Cancel puts back what was running before.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Switching profiles no longer unlinks your fans, and an open fan curve no longer disappears when you switch.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
